:0;transform:translateY(20px)">Before any outreach, campaign, or strategy, you need one thing:<br/>A clear map of your market and ideal customers.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-24"><div class="bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-primary/10 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 13.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H8.25m5.231 13.481L15 17.25m-4.5-15H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v16.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 0 0-9-9Zm3.75 11.625a2.625 2.625 0 1 1-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 0 1 5.25 0Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-3">Scattered data across tools and spreadsheets</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Consolidate all your market research in one place with our unified platform.</p></div><div class="bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-primary/10 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 3 19.875v-6.75ZM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V8.625ZM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V4.125Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-3">Generic filters that miss the nuance</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Our AI-powered filters understand context and deliver precise results.</p></div><div class="bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-primary/10 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-3">Hours of research with inconsistent quality</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Automate research tasks and ensure consistent, high-quality data.</p></div><div class="bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-primary/10 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0 3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0 0 13.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0 1 13.803-3.7l3.181 3.182m0-4.991v4.99"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-3">Growth gets blocked by messy workflows and bad data</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Streamline your workflow with clean, verified data that drives growth.</p></div></div><div class="relative" style="opac