xt-neutral-800 mb-3 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Market Research</h3><p class="text-body text-neutral-600 mb-4">Deep insights, instantly available</p><p class="text-body-sm text-neutral-500 mb-6 flex-grow">Get comprehensive market analysis and competitor insights powered by AI and real-time data.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors" href="/use-cases/research">Learn More<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-4 h-4 ml-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="w-[calc(33.333%-1rem)] flex-shrink-0" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="h-full bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden group relative"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.15]" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at center, #705CF6 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);background-size:24px 24px"></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-primary/20 p-8 h-full flex flex-col relative z-10"><div class="bg-white/10 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.59 14.37a6 6 0 0 1-5.84 7.38v-4.8m5.84-2.58a14.98 14.98 0 0 0 6.16-12.12A14.98 14.98 0 0 0 9.631 8.41m5.96 5.96a14.926 14.926 0 0 1-5.841 2.58m-.119-8.54a6 6 0 0 0-7.381 5.84h4.8m2.581-5.84a14.927 14.927 0 0 0-2.58 5.84m2.699 2.7c-.103.021-.207.041-.311.06a15.09 15.09 0 0 1-2.448-2.448 14.9 14.9 0 0 1 .06-.312m-2.24 2.39a4.493 4.493 0 0 0-1.757 4.306 4.493 4.493 0 0 0 4.306-1.758M16.5 9a1.5 1.5 0 1 1-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-h4 text-neutral-800 mb-3 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Startup Intelligence</h3><p class="text-body text-neutral-600 mb-4">Track the next unicorns</p><p class="text-body-sm text-neutral-500 mb-6 flex-grow">Monitor emerging startups, track growth signals, and identify investment opportunities early.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors" href="/use-cases/startup-intelligence">Learn More<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-4 h-4 ml-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><button class="absolute -left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 bg-white shadow-lg rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-800 hover:text-primary transition-colors z-10" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5 8.25 12l7.5-7.5"></path></svg></button><button class="absolute -right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 bg-white shadow-lg rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-800 hover:text-primary transition-colors z-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></button><div class="flex justify-center gap-2 mt-8"><button class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-primary"></button><button class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-neutral-300"></button></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-neutral-50 py-24"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center text-neutral-800 mb-16">The all-in-one solution to build skilled agents<br/>for large-scale operations.</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6"><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-primary/5 group border border-grey-500/10"><div class="flex items-start gap-6"><div class="bg-primary/10 p-4 rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-8 h-8 text-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904 9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09 3.09ZM18.259 8.715 18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 0 0 2.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 0 0 2.456 2.456L21.75 6l-1.035.259a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-2.456 2.456ZM16.894 20.567 16.5 21.75l-.394-1.183a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-1.423-1.423L13.5 18.75l1.183-.394a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 1.423-1.423l.394-1.183.394 1.183a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 1.423 1.423l1.183.394-1.183.394a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-1.423 1.423Z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">State-of-the-art generalist agent</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 mt-2">Advanced AI agent capable of understanding complex queries and delivering precise results through natural language processing.</p></div></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-primary/5 group border border-grey-500/10"><div class="flex items-start gap-6"><div class="bg-primary/10 p-4 rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-8 h-8 text-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 0 0 3.741-.479 3 3 0 0 0-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0 1 12 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 0 1 6 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 0 0-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0 0 12 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 0 0-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 0 0-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 0 0 3.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 0 0-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 1 1-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 1 1-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Domain-specific specialised agents</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 mt-2">Tailored agents with deep expertise in specific industries, ensuring accurate and relevant data enrichment for your sector.</p></div></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-primary/5 group border border-grey-500/10"><div class="flex items-start gap-6"><div class="bg-primary/10 p-4 rounded-xl"><svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 15V17M6 21H18C19.1046 21 20 20.1046 20 19V13C20 11.8954 19.1046 11 18 11H6C4.89543 11 4 11.8954 4 13V19C4 20.1046 4.89543 21 6 21ZM16 11V7C16 4.79086 14.2091 3 12 3C9.79086 3 8 4.79086 8 7V11H16Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-800 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Agent secure access management</h3><p class="text-neutral-600 mt-2">No client-specific data is exposed in AI training or sourcing. Industry-leading encryption at rest &amp; in transit (AES-256, TLS 1.2+)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Plug Into Your Workflow</h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12">Seamlessly integrate our powerful API into your existing tools and processes. Get instant access to enriched company data with just a few lines of code.</p></div><div class="space-y-16"><div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto my-8 px-4"><div class="relative h-[550px] w-full bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-kuration-border-light" style="opacity:0.5"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5 z-0"><svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><pattern id="grid" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 40 0 L 0 0 0 40" fill="none" stroke="#7C5DFA" stroke-width="0.5"></path></pattern></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#grid)"></rect></svg></div><div class="absolute top-[30px] left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(-10px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-kuration-text-primary">Company Research API Endpoint</h3><p class="text-sm text-kuration-text-secondary mt-1">Send company name → Receive enriched data</p></div><div class="absolute top-[100px] left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-20" style="opacity:0"><div class="flex space-x-4"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md flex items-center justify-center border border-kuration-border-light relative z-20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(-20px)"><div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z"></path><path fill="#34A853" d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7