                      bg-[#7C5DFA] rotate-45"><span class="text-2xl text-white">+</span></div></button><div style="height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="px-6 pb-6"><div class="relative"><div class="absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#7C5DFA] to-transparent"></div><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Kuration AI is an advanced platform that uses AI to make business research easier and more efficient. It helps you discover new companies, enrich your existing data, and monitor market changes in real time. Whether you&#x27;re in sales, market research, or competitor tracking, Kuration AI provides the tools to save time and gain deeper insights.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full p-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between group"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold group-hover:text-[#7C5DFA] transition-colors">Where does Kuration AI get its data?</h3><div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-all duration-300
