                      bg-[#7C5DFA]/10 group-hover:bg-[#7C5DFA]/20"><span class="text-2xl text-[#7C5DFA]">+</span></div></button></div><div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full p-6 text-left flex items-center justify-between group"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold group-hover:text-[#7C5DFA] transition-colors">How often is data updated?</h3><div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-all duration-300
